  ============================================
  SECTION 6 — REAL TALK (Objection Handling)
  Whipped Tallow & Honey Balm
  ============================================

  HOW TO USE:
  1. Go to Online Store → Themes → Customize
  2. Add a "Custom Liquid" block on the product page
  3. Paste this entire file into the Custom Liquid box

  NO IMAGE NEEDED (text-focused section)

  BRAND COLORS:
  - Primary teal: #2d6b5d
  - Cream bg: #f7f3ed

  MOBILE OPTIMIZED
  ============================================
{% endcomment %}

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@500;600&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
  .section-real-talk {
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', -apple-system, sans-serif;
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 48px auto;
    padding: 0 20px;
    color: #2a2a2a;
  }

  .section-real-talk__header {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    margin: 0 0 32px;
    line-height: 1.2;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .section-real-talk__qa {
    max-width: 560px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .section-real-talk__item {
    padding: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    background: #f7f3ed;
    border-radius: 12px;
    border-left: 3px solid #2d6b5d;
  }

  .section-real-talk__question {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .section-real-talk__answer {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #444;
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .section-real-talk {
      margin: 32px auto;
    }
    .section-real-talk__header {
      font-size: 26px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .section-real-talk__item {
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .section-real-talk__question {
      font-size: 19px;
    }
    .section-real-talk__answer {
      font-size: 15px;
    }
  }
</style>

<section class="section-real-talk">
  <h2 class="section-real-talk__header">Questions you're already asking.</h2>

  <div class="section-real-talk__qa">

    <div class="section-real-talk__item">
      <p class="section-real-talk__question">Does it smell like beef?</p>
      <p class="section-real-talk__answer">
        No. The tallow is properly rendered and whipped with manuka honey. You'll smell honey and a subtle warmth — not a steakhouse.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="section-real-talk__item">
      <p class="section-real-talk__question">Will it feel greasy?</p>
      <p class="section-real-talk__answer">
        For about 2-3 minutes, yes. Then it absorbs completely. That's how you know it's working — your skin is pulling it in.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="section-real-talk__item">
      <p class="section-real-talk__question">Will it break me out?</p>
      <p class="section-real-talk__answer">
        If you have oily or acne-prone skin, tallow may not be for you. This is made for dry, mature, sensitive, or damaged skin.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
